    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 352,
      "text": "The ultimate goal is to simulate this system both classically (implementing the quantum circuit with matrix multiplication and tensor products) and quantum mechanically (such as through the IMB Q experience). These results could then be compared to the analytical solution that one would obtain by solving for the eigenvalues of the Hamiltonian matrix."
